    "geometry": "Independent continuous torso/shoulder/underarm/sleeve lofts with Catmull-Clark curvature, fused topology, real 0.0022 shell thickness, exact cuff/hem cuts, wide rounded neck openings, separate edge trim, densely projected curved pockets/yoke/seams and metallic zipper/teeth/pull. Full original source body geometry retained.",
    "weights": "Project-authored continuous torso/shoulder weights blend with original nearest-source upperarm/forearm skin weights; no body masks or deleted limbs. All 53-bone shared hierarchy and compatible inverse binds retained within 2e-6 in three separate skins.",
    "poses": "Two locally authored finite constant registered poses, neutral and reach. Whole 53-bone clips remain constant for two seconds, so frozen selected pose is deterministic without animation phase persistence.",
    "copyrightScope": "Complete CC0 Quaternius mannequin reused; all garments, tailoring geometry, local weight blending, poses and replacement PBR materials authored in this workspace.",
    "bodyGeometry": "Source has 13,744 indexed faces including one exact duplicate; Blender removes duplicate and all 13,743 unique faces remain. Independent packed skin bind-rest restoration maps every output triangle to original source coordinate connectivity. No body decimation, primitive substitution or mask."
  },
